tqmls1028a
==========

Available configurations:

- 8_5_11_14: MBLS1028A configuration (SERDES 0x85BE: SGMII / QSGMII / PCIe2 Gen2 / SATA)
- 8_5_11_11: MBLS1028A configuration (SERDES 0x85BE: SGMII / QSGMII / PCIe2 Gen3 / PCIe1 Gen3*)

*Note: PCIe1 is not available on the MBLS1028A board

RCW variants:

"rcw_800", "rcw_1000" and "rcw_1300" set the CPU core clock to
800/1000/1300 MHz, respectively. The correct RCW needs to be selected
depending on the maximum supported clock rate of the used LS1028A variant.
